==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|swëben}}, from {{inh|de|goh|swebēn}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*swibjaną||to move}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*sweyp-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*sweyb-||to twist, turn around}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|zweven||to float}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃveːbn̩/|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|schwebt|schwebte|geschwebt|auxiliary=sein}}

# to [[hover]], to [[float]]
# to [[soar]]

====Conjugation====
